The '''2022 West Lancashire Borough Council election''' took place on 5 May 2022 to elect members of [[West Lancashire]] [[Borough status in the United Kingdom|Borough]] Council in [[Lancashire]], [[England]].<ref>{{cite web
 |url= http://www.westlancs.gov.uk/about-the-council/elections-and-voting/official-election-and-referendum-notices.aspx
 |title= Official election and referendum notices
 |work= West Lancashire Borough Council
 |access-date=14 May 2022}}</ref>

